msgid ""
"The zram device could not be created. This kernel probably does not support "
"zram."
msgstr ""
"zram-enheden kunne ikke oprettes. Denne kerne understøtter sandsynligvis "
"ikke zram."

msgid "Please wait..."
msgstr "Vent venligst..."

