msgstr "Modtager"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "Image"

msgid "Kernel"
msgstr "Kerne"

msgid ""
"The kernel decides which memory features are available. It is part of the "
"image and cannot be changed by a plugin."
msgstr ""
"Kernen bestemmer, hvilke hukommelsesfunktioner der findes. Den er en del af "
"imaget og kan ikke ændres af et plugin."

msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

msgid "RAM"
msgstr "RAM"

#, python-format
msgid "%d times"
msgstr "%d gange"

#, python-format
msgid "last: %s, %s"
msgstr "senest: %s, %s"

msgid "never"
msgstr "aldrig"

msgid "Out of memory"
msgstr "Mangel på hukommelse"

msgid ""
"How often RAM and swap were full and the kernel had to end a program "
"(counted since the plugin was installed). If it happens, a swap file - or a "
"bigger one - helps."
msgstr ""
"Hvor ofte RAM og swap var fulde, og kernen måtte afslutte et program (talt "
"siden pluginet blev installeret). Sker det, hjælper en swapfil – eller en "
"større."

msgid "Swap support"
msgstr "Swap-understøttelse"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "ja"

msgid "no"
msgstr "nej"

msgid "Required for swap files, swap partitions and zram."
msgstr "Kræves til swapfiler, swappartitioner og zram."

msgid ""
"zram compresses swapped out memory inside the RAM (about 2-3:1) - no drive "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"zram komprimerer udskiftet hukommelse direkte i RAM (ca. 2-3:1) - intet drev"
" nødvendigt."

msgid "zram (compressed RAM)"
msgstr "zram (komprimeret RAM)"

msgid "zram algorithms"
msgstr "zram-algoritmer"

msgid "known after loading"
msgstr "kendes efter indlæsning"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithms offered by the kernel. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best."
msgstr ""
"Komprimeringsalgoritmer, som kernen tilbyder. lz4 er hurtigst, zstd "
"komprimerer bedst."

#, python-format
msgid "active (%s)"
msgstr "aktiv (%s)"

msgid "available, inactive"
msgstr "tilgængelig, inaktiv"

msgid "zswap"
msgstr "zswap"

msgid ""
"zswap is a compressed cache in front of a swap file. It is only shown here "
"for information."
msgstr ""
"zswap er en komprimeret cache foran en swapfil. Den vises her kun til "
"orientering."

msgid "none (only internal flash)"
msgstr "ingen (kun intern flash)"

msgid "none"
msgstr "ingen"

msgid "Drives for swap files"
msgstr "Drev til swapfiler"

msgid ""
"Drives with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) that can hold a swap "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Drev med et Linux-filsystem (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...), der kan rumme en swapfil."

msgid "Kernel configuration"
msgstr "Kernekonfiguration"

msgid ""
"/proc/config.gz lets the plugin see exactly which features the kernel was "
"built with."
msgstr ""
"Med /proc/config.gz kan pluginet se præcis, hvilke funktioner kernen er "
"bygget med."

msgid "Swappiness"
msgstr "Swappiness"

msgid "Page size"
msgstr "Sidestørrelse"

#, python-format
msgid "%d bytes"
msgstr "%d byte"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger for Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gem"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Fra"

msgid "Swap file at startup"
msgstr "Swapfil ved opstart"

msgid ""
"This swap file is activated automatically every time the receiver starts. "
"The plugin waits up to three minutes for the storage device to be mounted."
msgstr ""
"Denne swapfil aktiveres automatisk, hver gang modtageren starter. Pluginet "
"venter op til tre minutter på, at drevet monteres."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"How eagerly the kernel moves memory to swap (0-100). Lower values keep data "
"in RAM longer; 10-30 is a good choice for receivers. Current value: %d"
msgstr ""
"Hvor ivrigt kernen flytter hukommelse til swap (0-100). Lave værdier holder "
"data længere i RAM; 10-30 er et godt valg til modtagere. Aktuel værdi: %d"

msgid ""
"Lower values also mean fewer writes, which spares SD cards and USB sticks."
msgstr ""
"Lave værdier betyder også færre skrivninger, hvilket skåner SD-kort og USB-"
"nøgler."

#, python-format
msgid "Automatic (%s)"
msgstr "Automatisk (%s)"

msgid "zram compression"
msgstr "zram-komprimering"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithm for the compressed RAM swap. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best but needs more CPU. A change takes effect the next time zram"
" is set up."
msgstr ""
"Komprimeringsalgoritme til den komprimerede RAM-swap. lz4 er hurtigst, zstd "
"komprimerer bedst, men kræver mere CPU. Ændringen gælder næste gang zram "
"sættes op."

msgid "zram at startup"
msgstr "zram ved opstart"

#, python-format
msgid "Set up the compressed RAM swap (%s) every time the receiver starts."
msgstr "Sæt den komprimerede RAM-swap (%s) op, hver gang modtageren starter."

msgid "On"
msgstr "Til"

msgid "Show plugin in"
msgstr "Vis plugin i"

msgid ""
"Where Simple Swap Manager can be opened. A change takes effect after "
"restarting the GUI."
msgstr ""
"Hvor Simple Swap Manager kan åbnes. Ændringen gælder efter genstart af GUI."

msgid ""
"Shows what this receiver supports: kernel, zram, zswap and drives. Press OK "
"to open."
msgstr ""
"Viser, hvad denne modtager understøtter: kerne, zram, zswap og drev. Tryk OK"
" for at åbne."

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Åbn"

msgid "Uninstall plugin..."
msgstr "Afinstaller plugin..."

msgid ""
"Removes Simple Swap Manager from this receiver. You can choose whether the "
"swap space is kept or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Fjerner Simple Swap Manager fra denne modtager. Du kan vælge, om swapområdet"
" skal beholdes eller slettes."

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Afinstaller"

msgid "Uninstall Simple Swap Manager"
msgstr "Afinstaller Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager will be removed from this receiver."
msgstr "Simple Swap Manager fjernes fra denne modtager."

