"The existing swap file is in use and there is not enough free RAM to replace"
" it."
msgstr ""
"Den eksisterende swapfil er i brug, og der er ikke nok ledig RAM til at "
"erstatte den."

#, python-format
msgid "%s will be recreated with %s instead of %s."
msgstr "%s oprettes igen med %s i stedet for %s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A swap file of %s will be created at\n"
"%s\n"
"and activated at every startup."
msgstr ""
"En swapfil på %s oprettes i\n"
"%s\n"
"og aktiveres ved hver opstart."

#, python-format
msgid "The existing swap file (%s) will be replaced."
msgstr "Den eksisterende swapfil (%s) bliver erstattet."

#, python-format
msgid "This takes about %d seconds."
msgstr "Det tager ca. %d sekunder."

msgid "Create swap file?"
msgstr "Opret swapfil?"

